@Sora.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5151

GET {{Sora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Registro (solo entorno Development)
POST {{Sora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Administrador de prueba",
  "email": "admin@sora.local",
  "password": "Cambiar-Esta-Clave-123!"
}

### Inicio de sesión
POST {{Sora.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@sora.local",
  "password": "Cambiar-Esta-Clave-123!"
}
